WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Narrator: At Gate 4, forty minutes to the match.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.400
Narrator: Fans ask all kinds of questions.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.800
Fan: One - excuse me, how do I get to Block 214?

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.100
Fan: Two - which gate for Row K?

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.200
Fan: Three - where's the nearest prayer room?

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.800
Fan: Four - excuse me, where are the toilets?

7
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.200
Fan: Five - where can I leave the stroller?

8
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.700
Fan: Six - is there a lift near here?

9
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.900
Fan: Seven - which way do I go in

10
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.400
Fan: to reach my seat?

11
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.500
Fan: Eight - I lost my phone. Who can I talk to?

12
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.400
Fan: Nine - where's the first aid point?

13
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.600
Fan: Ten - can I bring the drum into the stadium?
